In the spot, a therapist is listening to a patient drone on when a cheap flight pops up on her iPhone. Her wallet is across the room and she can't get up to grab it, so she opens up the iPhone Wallet app, applies for an &zwnj;Apple Card&zwnj;, and is able to purchase a flight within a couple of minutes.<br/>
